        "contentHtml": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;\"><h2 style=\"color:#2D5A27;\">Your Home Value Estimate</h2><p>Hi {{ $node[\"Process Data\"].json.name }},</p><p>Thank you for requesting a home value estimate for <strong>{{ $node[\"Process Data\"].json.address }}</strong>.</p><p>Your preliminary estimate is being finalized. I'll provide a detailed Comparative Market Analysis (CMA) with comparable sales in your area soon.</p><p>In the meantime, here are some details about your property:</p><ul><li>\ud83c\udfe0 {{ $node[\"Process Data\"].json.bedrooms }} bed / {{ $node[\"Process Data\"].json.bathrooms }} bath</li><li>\ud83d\udcd0 {{ $node[\"Process Data\"].json.sqft }} sq ft</li><li>\ud83d\udcc5 Built {{ $node[\"Process Data\"].json.yearBuilt }}</li></ul><p>I'd love to discuss your options. Reply to this email or call me anytime!</p><p>- Lorena</p></div>",
